        "subject": "=Persetujuan Cuti Diperlukan - {{ $('Calculate Duration & Validate').item.json['Nama Karyawan'] }}",
        "message": "=<h2>Permohonan Cuti Baru</h2>\n<p>Karyawan: <strong>{{ $('Calculate Duration & Validate').item.json['Nama Karyawan'] }}</strong> ({{ $json.Email }})</p>\n<p>Tanggal: <strong>{{ $json[\"Tanggal Mulai\"] }}</strong> s/d <strong>{{ $json[\"Tanggal Selesai\"] }}</strong></p>\n<p>Durasi: <strong>{{ $json.Durasi }} Hari</strong></p>\n<p>Alasan: <strong>{{ $json.Alasan }}</strong></p>\n<p>Sisa Saldo Saat Ini: <strong>{{ $('Calculate Duration & Validate').item.json['Saldo Cuti'] }} Hari</strong></p>\n\n<br>\n<p>Silakan berikan keputusan Anda:</p>\n<a href=\"https://rifqie.app.n8n.cloud/webhook-test/leave-approval?id={{ $json.ID }}&status=Approved\" style=\"padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #28a745; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;\">Setujui</a>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://rifqie.app.n8n.cloud/webhook-test/leave-approval?id={{ $json.ID }}&status=Rejected\" style=\"padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #dc3545; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;\">Tolak</a>",
